        {
          "page_number": 1,
          "kind": "footnote",
          "text": "NOTE. An additional Net Investment Income Tax of 3.8 percent applies to the lesser of net investment income or the excess of modified\nadjusted gross income over $200,000 (single and head of household), $250,000 (married filing jointly) or $125,000 (married filing separately).\nThis surtax is imposed in addition to the rates shown in Table | and is not reflected in those rates.",
